# Destinations that must bypass the VPN. They are reached directly, through the
# normal network of the container (from there on the network rules of the host apply).
# One entry per line, "#" starts a comment. Copy this file to "list" and edit it:
#   cp bypass/list.example bypass/list
#
# An entry is one of:
#   an IPv4 address       203.0.113.10
#   an IPv4 network       192.168.0.0/16
#   a public host name    example.com   (resolved to IPv4 addresses when the script runs)

# local networks
192.168.0.0/16
10.0.0.0/8

# address of a local VPN server
# 203.0.113.10

# a public name
# example.com
